msgstr "大家一起，從沙堡出發，穿越隨機生成的地圖。"

#. Key:	MissionBlurbRace
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Tortunabo/Private/Lobby/TN_LobbyMission.cpp(90)
#: Source/Tortunabo/Private/Lobby/TN_LobbyMission.cpp(90)
